title: Raspbian
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The Debian-based operating system for the [[Raspberry Pi]]. Renamed Raspberry Pi OS on May 28, 2020.

Raspbian Lite boots to a text console with no desktop. A fuller version adds the PIXEL desktop.

See [[Raspbian download page (2018)|https://www.raspberrypi.org/downloads/raspbian/]] and [[a 2021 guide to Openbox on Raspberry Pi OS Lite|https://forums.raspberrypi.com/viewtopic.php?t=312104]].

Used in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
